%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 28ec8b4c43df9884dab1e56106bf74dc, type: 3}
  m_Name: Run1_Milo
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueSequence
  lines:
  - speakerName: MILO
    speakerSubtitle: 
    speakerSprite: {fileID: 0}
    text: Trench got anything new to say? Or is he still the remorseful grumpy grave
      keeper he always is?
  - speakerName: PLAYER
    speakerSubtitle: 
    speakerSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 42c9230344a709440979c825b0fc9b71, type: 3}
    text: Are you Milo?
  - speakerName: MILO
    speakerSubtitle: 
    speakerSprite: {fileID: 0}
    text: Why is every version of you more confused than the previous one?
  - speakerName: PLAYER
    speakerSubtitle: 
    speakerSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 42c9230344a709440979c825b0fc9b71, type: 3}
    text: Every version of me?
  - speakerName: MILO
    speakerSubtitle: 
    speakerSprite: {fileID: 0}
    text: A thousand deaths, a thousand fresh bodies. And every single one of you
      starts with that exact same blank stare.
  - speakerName: PLAYER
    speakerSubtitle: 
    speakerSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 42c9230344a709440979c825b0fc9b71, type: 3}
    text: What is this place?
  - speakerName: MILO
    speakerSubtitle: 
    speakerSprite: {fileID: 0}
    text: You'll figure it out. Come meet Master Shin, you must've met him before,
      surely. Let's walk.
  - speakerName: PLAYER
    speakerSubtitle: 
    speakerSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 42c9230344a709440979c825b0fc9b71, type: 3}
    text: What are these statues?
  - speakerName: MILO
    speakerSubtitle: 
    speakerSprite: {fileID: 0}
    text: They're the statues of the Caretakers of this world. All the previous generations
      with the Creator, the God, in the middle
  - speakerName: PLAYER
    speakerSubtitle: 
    speakerSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 42c9230344a709440979c825b0fc9b71, type: 3}
    text: So I was summoned by a Caretaker?
  - speakerName: MILO
    speakerSubtitle: 
    speakerSprite: {fileID: 0}
    text: Yes, that's Atlas, the first Caretaker, who's sculpture was created by
      the Second Caretaker. Hence there are five of them, since we live in the sixth
      generation of Caretakers.
  - speakerName: MILO
    speakerSubtitle: 
    speakerSprite: {fileID: 0}
    text: We're here.
